                                 + "\n\t\u2022 Hold CTRL and left click to shoot."
                                 + "\n\u2022 To know more about Chance To Hit, Damage, Critical or other effect calculations use a training dummy in a tent or base.");

        tooltipsKey.insertLast(SK_ENERGY_WEAPONS);
